      "section": "Introduction",
      "first_line_excerpt": "Most machine-learning work on the electrocardiogram (ECG) is supervised. Several clinically interesting questi"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0013",
      "sha256": "ffddd8a0ac74561bcc76286218b9abd33f103612bda33d55d386e5dcfeedf200",
      "char_start": 3463,
      "char_end": 4127,
      "n_chars": 664,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "first_line_excerpt": "This study began as a re-examination of a master's project that clustered whole"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0014",
      "sha256": "0542ff5c2ef1dd9ff4bc490257b360d79be88186a8ed345dbd9aa40ebed68720",
      "char_start": 4129,
      "char_end": 4862,
      "n_chars": 733,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "first_line_excerpt": "A representation can carry information about a label and still fail to cluster by it. Linear separability and "
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0015",
      "sha256": "231de82f928206167ea4e44f5eab903956ce19416a9db15a080076de6b48a8f5",
      "char_start": 4864,
      "char_end": 5619,
      "n_chars": 755,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "first_line_excerpt": "The most directly related work, by Filice et al.~\\cite{lookingbeyond2026}, benchmarks ECG foundation models ag"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0016",
      "sha256": "fc7058cee6c9bb703e9323f3894316e9587796ecafe0da58870e37a8eb5aec92",
      "char_start": 5621,
      "char_end": 7337,
      "n_chars": 1716,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "first_line_excerpt": "We therefore compare five representations for the unsupervised separation of sinus rhythm (SR) from atrial fib"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0017",
      "sha256": "4afdec2dfaa41e91e84c8aeb37b136759effc3da5decf940f5cf2292f405ecda",
      "char_start": 7339,
      "char_end": 7380,
