      "char_start": 9532,
      "char_end": 10438,
      "n_chars": 906,
      "section": "Related work",
      "first_line_excerpt": "\\paragraph{ECG foundation-model benchmarks.} Several recent studies benchmark ECG foundation models on supervi"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0021",
      "sha256": "36e4a8a75a6d1243367df67a0424b1ce76d9629aa5e6e9e345a0364cdf3ba14d",
      "char_start": 10440,
      "char_end": 11389,
      "n_chars": 949,
      "section": "Related work",
      "first_line_excerpt": "\\paragraph{Closest benchmark.} Filice et al.~\\cite{lookingbeyond2026} evaluate ECG-FM, ECGFounder, HuBERT-ECG "
    },
    {
