      "char_start": 11460,
      "char_end": 12218,
      "n_chars": 758,
      "section": "Data and cohorts",
      "first_line_excerpt": "\\paragraph{PTB-XL.} We use PTB-XL, a public database of 10\\,s 12-lead recordings, whose data descriptor report"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0025",
      "sha256": "ef6ef53c497323723fa6d182cd0ab8d7aa1645d38962889a99c2e65aab2f4677",
      "char_start": 12220,
      "char_end": 13508,
      "n_chars": 1288,
      "section": "Data and cohorts",
      "first_line_excerpt": "Rhythm labels are taken from the statements of the Standard Communication Protocol for computer-assisted elect"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0026",
      "sha256": "e1f52b328fa9f69afec04ccdd6a57607db14f1a725940e453994a0a6aed93279",
      "char_start": 13510,
      "char_end": 14289,
      "n_chars": 779,
      "section": "Data and cohorts",
      "first_line_excerpt": "\\paragraph{MIT-BIH.} For generalization we use the MIT-BIH Arrhythmia Database \\cite{mitbih2001,physionet2000}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0027",
      "sha256": "91e4e2252c72a8cd819c7c8d185fb0b852b467bc889e68c5f638fa0e0c9a0a34",
