      "char_end": 22126,
      "n_chars": 55,
      "section": "Representations",
      "first_line_excerpt": "\\subsection{Clustering and evaluation}\\label{sec:clust}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0034",
      "sha256": "6425a8bddc8fc3b963c647bf04db09f6e66cbf34b7859d27dcd04f89082cfdbf",
      "char_start": 22128,
      "char_end": 23388,
      "n_chars": 1260,
      "section": "Clustering and evaluation",
      "first_line_excerpt": "Each representation is clustered with five algorithms \\cite{sklearn2011}: $k$-means, Ward agglomerative cluste"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0035",
      "sha256": "e7945086dddbe76ce3bbda10755945de122388cfe187ccd2d19b147f4e2469c7",
      "char_start": 23390,
      "char_end": 24084,
      "n_chars": 694,
      "section": "Clustering and evaluation",
      "first_line_excerpt": "Table~\\ref{tab:metrics} gives the meaning, formula and range of each metric. The headline metrics are the ARI "
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0036",
      "sha256": "995a8e5801ad7379a9804e1975bc9320c3346c38eca3405526fa0aaee3423ede",
      "char_start": 24086,
      "char_end": 24567,
      "n_chars": 481,
      "section": "Clustering and evaluation",
      "first_line_excerpt": "A supervised ceiling measures how much of the label a classifier recovers from the same representation under t"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0037",
      "sha256": "c1a52423f837703f98d9baa42c28428ed110ea762c285c48fcec16460bc2256a",
      "char_start": 24569,
      "char_end": 25467,
      "n_chars": 898,
      "section": "Clustering and evaluation",
      "first_line_excerpt": "In the main benchmark each fit of $k$-means, spectral clustering and the GMM is repeated over ten seeds. The c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0038",
      "sha256": "dd207fda0baa189fb232c74ecb25998458054cabd367ef205cfefbf845dbfddb",
      "char_start": 25469,
      "char_end": 26626,
      "n_chars": 1157,
      "section": "Clustering and evaluation",
      "first_line_excerpt": "Because heavy-tailed features can dominate Euclidean distance, four conditioners are swept: the Yeo-Johnson po"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0039",
      "sha256": "04feef30da29230b3da7c4be4d3921794ef9232f4f3fa9d39cb9e3b707786a1d",
      "char_start": 26628,
      "char_end": 29162,
      "n_chars": 2534,
      "section": "Clustering and evaluation",
      "first_line_excerpt": "\\begin{table}[t]"
    },
    {
