      "n_chars": 1192,
      "section": "Discussion",
      "first_line_excerpt": "The practical reading holds for the settings tested: two binary tasks, five clusterers, two named foundation m"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0071",
      "sha256": "b87d5f563331e8c2e6bb8a7c909d07836a0a7d497fa219984f60dd3d30643b9a",
      "char_start": 50009,
      "char_end": 50368,
      "n_chars": 359,
      "section": "Discussion",
      "first_line_excerpt": "The result also reframes the original master's project. Its conclusion that the bottleneck is the representati"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0072",
      "sha256": "240e9d00591fe94065875433440864fb4ee7784068728673e14835d6df765f67",
      "char_start": 50370,
      "char_end": 52071,
      "n_chars": 1701,
      "section": "Discussion",
      "first_line_excerpt": "We propose no new algorithm. The gap between linear-probe accuracy and clustering quality has been reported fo"
    },
    {
