      "char_end": 53206,
      "n_chars": 1087,
      "section": "Limitations",
      "first_line_excerpt": "ECGFounder expects 500\\,Hz input. Because the 500\\,Hz records could not be obtained in bulk from the source, t"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0075",
      "sha256": "9e7c83cb704400b8016f1e8f6e41c597a77d8b621866091d568b5d3cd78d1883",
